#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 16
#: rc.cpp:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings - Filelight"
msgstr "Instellen - Filelight"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 34
#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scannin&g"
msgstr "&Dörkieken"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 53
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do &not scan these directories:"
msgstr "Disse Ornen &nich dörkieken:"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 70
#: rc.cpp:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Filelight will not scan these directories unless you specifically request them."
msgstr "Filelight kiekt disse Ornern nich dör, wenn Du se nich extra angiffst."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 106
#: rc.cpp:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "R&emove"
msgstr "&Wegmaken"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 117
#: rc.cpp:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Add..."
msgstr "&Tofögen..."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 202
#: rc.cpp:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exclude remote files&ystems"
msgstr "Feern Dateis&ystemen utsluten"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 208
#: rc.cpp:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Prevents scanning of filesystems that are not on this computer, e.g. NFS or "
"Samba mounts."
msgstr ""
"Verhöödt dat Dörkieken vun Dateisystemen, de nich op dissen Reekner liggt, t.B. "
"NFS- oder Samba-Freegaven."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 216
#: rc.cpp:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scan across filesystem &boundaries"
msgstr "Över Dateisysteem&grenzen weggahn"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 219
#: rc.cpp:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allows scans to enter directories that are part of other filesystems. For "
"example, when unchecked, this will usually prevent the contents of <b>/mnt</b> "
"from being scanned if you scan <b>/</b>."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt ok Ornern op anner Dateisystemen dörkeken. Is dit "
"utmaakt, un Du kiekst \"/\" dör, warrt normalerwies nix dörkeken, wat ünner "
"\"/mnt/\" inhangt is."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 230
#: rc.cpp:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "E&xclude removable media"
msgstr "Wesselmedium &utsluten"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 236
#: rc.cpp:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "Prevents Filelight from scanning removable media (eg. CD-ROMs)."
msgstr "Verhöödt, dat Filelight Wesselmedien (t.B. CD-ROMs) dörkiekt."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 248
#: rc.cpp:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Appearance"
msgstr "&Utsehn"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 259
#: rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scheme"
msgstr "Schema"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 291
#: rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Co&ntrast"
msgstr "Ko&ntrast"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 314
#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can vary the contrast of the filemap in realtime."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du den Kontrast vun de Dateikoort ännern."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 326
#: rc.cpp:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Use anti-aliasing"
msgstr "&Kantstreken bruken"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 329
#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Anti-aliasing the filemap makes it clearer and prettier, unfortunately it also "
"makes rendering very slow."
msgstr ""
"En kantstreken Dateikoort is wat klorer un smucker, man dat Dorstellen geiht "
"denn bannig langsam."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 351
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Var&y label font sizes"
msgstr "&Verscheden Schriftgrötten för Betekers bruken"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 354
#: rc.cpp:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The font size of exploded labels can be varied relative to the depth of the "
"directories they represent. This helps you spot the important labels more "
"easily. Set a sensible minimum font size."
msgstr ""
"De Schriftgrött vun opklappt Betekers lett sik langs de Deepde vun ehr tohören "
"Ornern topassen, Du kannst denn de wichtigen Betekers lichter finnen, man legg "
"de sietste Schriftgrött sinnig fast."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 390
#: rc.cpp:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Minimum font si&ze:"
msgstr "S&ietst Schriftgrött:"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 399
#: rc.cpp:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "The smallest font size Filelight can use to render labels."
msgstr "De lüttste Schrift, de Filelight för Betekers bruukt"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 442
#: rc.cpp:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show small files"
msgstr "Lütt Dateien wiesen"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 445
#: rc.cpp:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some files are too small to be rendered on the filemap. Selecting this option "
"makes these files visible by merging them all into a single \"multi-segment\"."
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft Dateien, de sünd to lütt, as dat se op de Koort wiest warrt. Maakst "
"Du dit an, warrt se all tosamen binnen een \"Mehrdelen-Afsnitt\" wiest."

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 464
#: rc.cpp:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Reset"
msgstr "&Torüchsetten"

#. i18n: file ./src/part/dialog.ui line 470
#: rc.cpp:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset any changes you have made since you opened this dialog."
msgstr "All ännern binnen dissen Dialoog torüchnehmen"

